  "hero_summary_zh": "娜迦海妖派出镜像的复制体攻击敌人，诱捕敌人将他们斩落，带领友军走向胜利。她还可以运用自己的嗓音，镇住周围的敌人，发动奇袭或组织快速的撤离。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Sending squads of mirrored clones against her foes, Naga Siren ensnares and slays enemies as she leads her forces to victory. With the sound of her voice, she disables nearby foes to spring an ambush or crafting a hasty escape.",
