    {
      "name": "naga_siren_song_of_the_siren",
      "id": 5470,
      "name_zh": "海妖之歌",
      "name_en": "Song of the Siren",
      "description_zh": "娜迦海妖周围的所有敌人受到魔法影响陷入停滞状态，既无法行动也不会受到攻击。再次使用海妖之歌可以提前停止效果。",
      "description_en": "All enemies in range of the Naga Siren are put into a magical stasis where they cannot act or be attacked. Using Song of the Siren again will end the duration early.",
      "notes_zh": [
        "海妖之歌作用下的单位处于无敌状态，不会受到任何伤害。",
        "海妖之歌的作用范围以娜迦海妖为中心，如果她远离了作用单位，他们将会醒来。"
      ],
      "notes_en": [
        "Units affected by Song of the Siren are invulnerable and cannot take damage from any source.",
        "The area of the song follows Naga, so if she moves far enough away from affected units, they will wake up."
      ],
